# AEGIS-Cloud — Telemetry & Health Logs Directory
# =================================================
# Buffer directory for AIOps health logs, telemetry streams, and
# simulation output files.
#
# Expected contents (generated at runtime):
#   • sim_cloud_sync.jsonl  — Simulation-mode D2C telemetry output
#   • vision_health.jsonl   — Vision Node FPS/latency metrics
#   • sensor_health.jsonl   — Sensor driver health reports
#   • fusion_telemetry.jsonl — Fused PlatformState records
